#: tips.cpp:3
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"10\" align=\"center\">\n"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/32x32/apps/digikamimageplugins.png\">\n"
"</td>\n"
"<td>\n"
"Did you know that you can keep a zone clear of raindrops with the\n"
"'Select' tool? Selecting the area to avoid (for example a face) before\n"
"launching the 'RainDrops' filter will keep it free from rain drops.\n"
"</td>\n"
"</tr>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"10\" align=\"center\">\n"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/32x32/apps/digikamimageplugins.png\">\n"
"</td>\n"
"<td>\n"
"តើ​អ្នក​ដឹង​ទេ​ថា​អ្នក​អាច​រក្សា​តំបន់​ឲ្យ​ជ្រះពី​គ្រាប់​ភ្លៀង​ជាមួយ​និង\nឧបករណ៍"
"'ជ្រើស' ? ជ្រើស​តំបន់​ដើម្បី​ជៀសវៀង (ឧ. ផ្ទៃមុខ) មុននិង\n"
"បើក​ដំណើរ​ការ​តម្រង់ 'RainDrops' នឹង​ជួយ​ការពារ​វា​មិន​ឲ្យ​ប៉ះពាល់​ដោយ​គ្រាប់ភ្លៀង ។\n"
"</td>\n"
"</tr>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:21
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"10\" align=\"center\">\n"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/32x32/apps/digikamimageplugins.png\">\n"
"</td>\n"
"<td>\n"
"Did you know that you can simulate the graininess of black-and-white photos "
"with the 'FilmGrain' image editor plugin.\n"
"</td>\n"
"</tr>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"10\" align=\"center\">\n"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/32x32/apps/digikamimageplugins.png\">\n"
"</td>\n"
"<td>\n"
"តើ​អ្នក​ដឹង​ទេ​ថា​អ្នក​អាច​ចម្លង​សាច់​នៃ​រូបភាព​ស-ខ្មៅ "
"ជាមួយ​និង​កម្មវិធី​ជំនួយ​កែប្រែ​រូបភាព 'FilmGrain' ។\n"
"</td>\n"
"</tr>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</p>\n"

